<title>UK: Schroder Ventures sells two ex-Rank units.</title>
<headline>Schroder Ventures sells two ex-Rank units.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private equity specialists Schroder Ventures said on Thursday that its has sold two of the businesses it bought from the Rank Organisation Plc in September.</p>
<p>Schroder said in a statement that it has disposed Cintel and Brimar to a buy-out team backed by venture capitalists 3i Group Plc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Schroder bought Rank Precision Industries, comprising Cintel, Brimar, Strand Lighting and Taylor Hobson, for 72 million stg.</p>
<p>It said that it will now concentrate its resources on Taylor Hobson.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
